+## F. Colour-space assumptions
+
+### F13a. sRGB decode of textures — decided offline, executed in hardware
+
+**The colour space is a property of the DDS, not of the shader slot.** The Resource Compiler
+stamps it per texture preset — `Code/Tools/RC/rc.ini`:
+
+```
+79:  [Albedo]                 85:  colorspace=sRGB,auto
+131: [Reflectance]            136: colorspace=sRGB,auto
+160: [Normals]                166: colorspace=linear,linear
+172: [NormalsWithSmoothness]  181: colorspace=linear,linear
+217: [Displacement]           224: colorspace=linear,linear
+230: [Terrain_Albedo]         235: colorspace=linear,linear   <-- terrain albedo is LINEAR
+348: [ColorChart]             354: colorspace=linear,linear
+377: [LensOptics]             383: colorspace=sRGB,auto
+424: [Opacity]                429: colorspace=linear,linear
+```
+
+Parsed at `Code/Tools/RC/ResourceCompilerImage/ImageProperties.h:321`. The `auto` output space,
+when it resolves to sRGB, stamps the image flag —
+`Code/Tools/RC/ResourceCompilerImage/Converters/Gamma.cpp:444`
+`get()->AddImageFlags(CImageExtensionHelper::EIF_SRGBRead);` (inverse at `:393`) — which selects
+the DXGI `_SRGB` variant on write, `Code/Tools/RC/ResourceCompilerImage/PixelFormats.cpp:561-573`
+(R8G8B8A8, BC1/BC2/BC3/BC7).
+
+Runtime: flag → texture → SRV format:
+
+* `CryCommon/Cry3DEngine/ImageExtensionHelper.h:196`
+  `const static uint32 EIF_SRGBRead = 0x800; //!< … this texture requires SRGBRead (it's not stored in linear).`
+* `Common/Textures/Image/DDSImage.cpp:510-511` → `m_Flags |= FIM_SRGB_READ;`
+* `Common/Textures/Texture.cpp:507` `m_bIsSRGB = (td->m_nFlags & FIM_SRGB_READ) != 0;`
+  (streaming path `Common/Textures/TextureStreaming.cpp:751`, hardware gate `:818`).
+  Storage/accessors `Common/Textures/Texture.h:724`, `:996-997`.
+* Device texture creation — `XRenderD3D9/DeviceManager/DeviceResources.cpp:321-333`:
+
+```cpp
+bIsSRGB &= (pLayout.m_pPixelFormat->Options & FMTSUPPORT_SRGB) && (pLayout.m_eFlags & (FT_USAGE_MSAA | FT_USAGE_RENDERTARGET | FT_USAGE_DEPTHSTENCIL)) == 0;
+if (bIsSRGB || (pLayout.m_eFlags & FT_USAGE_ALLOWREADSRGB))
+    nFormatSRGB = DeviceFormats::ConvertToSRGB(D3DFmt);
+if (bIsSRGB)
+    D3DFmt = nFormatSRGB;
+// must use typeless format to allow runtime casting
+if (pLayout.m_eFlags & FT_USAGE_ALLOWREADSRGB)
+    D3DFmt = DeviceFormats::ConvertToTypeless(D3DFmt);
+```
+
+  Note **render targets can never be sRGB-typed** here; they only get an *additional*
+  sRGB-readable view via `FT_USAGE_ALLOWREADSRGB`.
+* Default SRV `DeviceResources.cpp:70`; actual D3D SRV desc
+  `XRenderD3D9/DeviceManager/D3D11/DeviceResources_D3D11.inl:39-44` (same in
+  `D3D12/DeviceResources_D3D12.inl:38-42`, `Vulkan/DeviceResources_Vulkan.inl:56-58`).
+* Format tables: `XRenderD3D9/DeviceManager/DeviceFormats.cpp:884` `IsSRGBReadable()` — only
+  `R8G8B8A8_UNORM`, `B8G8R8A8_UNORM`, `B8G8R8X8_UNORM`, `BC1/BC2/BC3/BC7_UNORM` (+ ETC2/ASTC on
+  Vulkan); `:1542` `ConvertToSRGB()`; note the pass-through comment
+  `// AntonK: we don't need sRGB space for fp formats, because there is enough precision` for
+  `R16G16B16A16_FLOAT`.
+
+**Shader-side slot declarations are vestigial.** `Engine/Shaders/HWScripts/CryFX/FXSamplerDefs.cfi:5-19`
+declares `sRGBLookup = true` on diffuse (`:6`), detail (`:11`) and subsurface (`:15`) and leaves
+normals/specular/smoothness/height/decal/opacity/translucency/emittance linear. The annotation is
+parsed at `Common/Shaders/ShaderFXParseBin.cpp:1950` and copied around
+(`Common/Shaders/ShaderComponents.cpp:628`, `:646`, `:815`;
+`XRenderD3D9/D3DHWShaderCompiling.cpp:4084`, `:4106`) — but the only binder that consumed it is
+now a stub: `Common/PostProcess/PostProcessUtils.cpp:190-193`
+(`void SPostEffectsUtils::SetTexture(…, bool bSRGBLookup, …) { ASSERT_LEGACY_PIPELINE; }`), and
+`Common/CommonRender.h:369` marks the state field `// TODO: deprecate, use format`.
+**The DDS's own `_SRGB` format is the only live mechanism.**
+
+Render targets that request an sRGB-readable view: `$SceneNormalsMap`, `$SceneDiffuse`,
+`$SceneSpecular` — `GraphicsPipeline/Common/GraphicsPipeline.cpp:141-143`
+(`eTF_R8G8B8A8 … FT_USAGE_ALLOWREADSRGB`); plus Flash/Scaleform RTs at
+`Common/Textures/Texture.cpp:3238`, `:3285`.
+
+**Shader-side manual sRGB decode** exists only in post: `CommonMath.cfi:172-176` `SRGBToLinear()`,
+`:178-194` `SRGBToLinearApproximation()` (two overloads, Chilliant cubic). Users:
+`PostAA.cfx:330-353` (SMAA luma edge detection, on the already-encoded display target),
+`PostAA.cfx:789-793` (`REC709ToLinear` on Durango / `SRGBToLinear` elsewhere, inside
+`NeighborhoodBlendingSMAA`), `MobileComposition.cfx:200`
+(`OUT.Color.xyz = sqrt(OUT.Color.xyz);  // LinearToSRGB(...)`). CPU-side:
+`Common/Textures/Texture.cpp:3645-3653` calls `ColorF::srgb2rgb()`
+(`CryCommon/CryMath/Cry_Color.h:303`). No live `pow(x, 2.2)` decode exists — the only hits are
+commented out (`CommonSVO.cfi:1024`, `Total_Illumination.cfx:720`).
