+Targets are fp16: full-res `m_pTexHDRTarget`, half-res `m_pTexHDRTargetScaled[subRes][0]`
+(`SceneForward.cpp:1086`, `GraphicsPipeline.cpp:224-226`, `nHDRFormat`). Half-res selection
