+Colour clamps: **`Particles.cfi:722`** `cBaseColor.xyz = saturate(…)` in the `%COLOR_LOOKUP` path
+(hard `[0,1]` on colour) and **`:982`** `cFinal.rgb *= saturate(1 - GetLuminance(MatSpecColor));`
